  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="9678850f-4555-54f3-bed7-9fa6f700a851" activityNameId="6da18af2-2c05-5942-a350-5fb9b376f06f" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Diode, glass-, SMD type, surface mounting, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Diode, glass-, SMD type, surface mounting, at plant
The data represent a typical SMD type diode for surface mounting, used in the information and communication technology. Material data are taken from datasheets of producers of such diodes and from the literature. Infrastructure and production efforts are based on own assumptions. The dataset represents 1 kg of diodes with a weight of 32 miligram/unit. For all diode types, it is assumed the the material composition remains the same over the years (2023 updates).; UUID: 979e2eb7-9329-3843-bc6a-9fd8e4ad171b
This dataset covers raw material input and production efforts for the production of currently used SMD diodes for surface mounting technology.
Location: Data represent a global valuable composition of SMD type diodes.
Technology: average diode production technology, comprising the diode wafer production (cleaing, masking, etching, doping, oxidising, metal deposition) and the final assembly of the diode (wafer sawing, die bonding, moulding, trimming and forming)
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: literature
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_979e2eb7-9329-3843-bc6a-9fd8e4ad171b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
